A||||14||86SE||I Finally got BASS!!!||||14||
Z||000000||86SE||05-04-2000||12:00 AM||||After an hour of hard work manuvering a circular saw, sanding, screwing and glueing wood, I finally have a box that produces some thunderous bass!!  Its dimentions are 15" wide x 17" long x 7" high.  It holds 1 10" high-performance sub.  Its bridged into a 1 ohm MONO load on an 800watt amp and it POUNDS!!<P>The box fits in the passengeer foot well (no room for the passengers feet), so i am going to make quick connectors on the subs wireing so I can easily move the sub from the inside, to the trunk or to the other trunk.<P>It sounds good!!||||reg||14
