Z||000004||Homicidal||05-04-2000||09:56 AM||||My box is rougly the same.....the passenger footwell huh?<P>Which way is the woofer pointed, up towards the top, down towards the floor or what?<P>Tip:<P>When you move the sub to the trunks, take away more than HALF of the bass you feel now.  The Fiero has the Firewall in the rear so the bass will BARELY be felt and in the front it's not very good either.  I say keep it in the passenger footwell if possible!||||reg||1
